# box-arrows-typing (h5-box): type into a's box, ArrowUp, then Shift+ArrowDown.
# Nudges measure from the typed text (2.5 -> 2.60 -> 2.59 on the scale).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
click 331.5 450.5
type "2.5"
key ArrowUp
key ArrowDown shift
wait 400
shot box-arrows-typing
key Escape
wait 500
